sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as AI Worker
    participant CV as CV Feature Extractor
    participant F as Multimodal Fusion
    participant C as Confidence Engine
    participant R as Classical RAG
    participant LLM as OpenAI GPT-4o
    participant S as AI Safety Gate

    W->>CV: Extract Visual Observables (a*, b*, GLCM)
    CV-->>W: Visual Lakshanas Vector (D_vis)
    W->>F: Compute Fused Vector: 0.40(D_vis) + 0.35(D_quiz) + 0.25(D_life)
    F-->>W: Fused Tendency Vector
    W->>C: Calculate Harmonic Agreement A & Calibrated Confidence
    C-->>W: Confidence Object (Level, Limitations, Bounds)
    W->>R: Query pgvector (Cosine >= 0.75, Min 2 Matches)
    R-->>W: Grounded Classical Verses
    W->>LLM: Formulate Prompt with Grounded Shlokas & JSON Mode
    LLM-->>W: Structured JSON Reasoning Payload
    W->>S: Validate Schema (Zod), Scan Medical Terms (Regex), Verify Citation IDs
    alt Safety Violation Detected
        S->>W: Reject Generative Herbs -> Trigger Deterministic Fallback
    else Passes All Gates
        S-->>W: Approved 3NF Result Entities
    end
